  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fors 103.02 Composition of the Board. The board shall consist of 4 Forester members and 3 public members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 310-A:100.\n\nSource. #5222, eff 9-11-91; EXPIRED 9-11-97\n\nNew. #6597, INTERIM, eff 10-8-97, EXPIRED: 2-5-98\n\nNew. #6915, eff 12-22-98",
